[{"id":179620467,"discussion_id":"b856f104cbd3eb7230189cd5c549c1f7f5a13d68","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `SwigluGroupQuant` 模块中 `VFProcessGroupIndex` 函数的 `group_index` 计算异常问题。原实现使用向上取整后的 `loopCount` 除以 `FOUR_UNFOLD` 来计算 `fourLoopCount`，导致在列数边界条件下产生错误的循环次数和尾部长度。修复后改为直接基于 `curColNum` 与 `fourVecLen`（即 `vlLen * FOUR_UNFOLD`）进行整数除法，确保 `fourLoopCount`、`tailLoopNum` 和 `tailReminder` 的计算结果一致且正确，同时将分支条件从 `loopCount < FOUR_UNFOLD` 调整为 `fourLoopCount == 0`，使语义更精确。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`fourLoopCount` 计算逻辑修正**：将 `fourLoopCount = loopCount / FOUR_UNFOLD`（基于向上取整的循环次数）改为 `fourLoopCount = curColNum / fourVecLen`（直接基于列数整除），避免因 `CeilDiv` 引入的向上取整导致 `fourLoopCount` 偏大，进而引发 `group_index` 越界或错位。\n- **`tailLoopNum` 计算方式调整**：从 `loopCount % FOUR_UNFOLD` 改为 `loopCount - fourLoopCount * FOUR_UNFOLD`，与新的 `fourLoopCount` 定义保持一致，确保尾部循环数正确反映剩余未处理的迭代。\n- **`tailReminder` 计算优化与类型安全**：引入局部变量 `fourVecLen = vlLen * FOUR_UNFOLD` 统一复用，并对 `fourLoopCount` 添加 `static_cast<uint32_t>` 显式转换后参与乘法，避免 `uint16_t` 与 `uint32_t` 混合运算时潜在的溢出或截断问题。\n- **分支条件语义修正**：将 `if (loopCount < FOUR_UNFOLD)` 改为 `if (fourLoopCount == 0)`，直接判断是否需要展开处理，避免了原条件在 `loopCount` 恰好等于 `FOUR_UNFOLD` 时误入小规模处理分支的边界情况。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-11T17:13:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-11T17:15:52+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":179620469,"discussion_id":"fe49bbfe1a052f6ea141659f838b759e3fc77597","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-11T17:13:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-11T18:00:47+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9